{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Shears are a ",["l","工具","tool"]," used to collect ",["l","动物毛","wool"]," from ",["l","绵羊","sheep"],". They must be purchased from ",["l","玛妮的牧场","Marnie's Ranch"]," for 1,000g."]],["p",["Each use of the Shears to shear a sheep consumes 4 points of ",["l","能量","energy"],", and increases the player's ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," experience by 5 points."]],["p",["Once the player has reached ",["l","耕种","Farming Level 10"],", an ",["l","自动采集器","Auto-Grabber"]," can be purchased from Marnie's Ranch for 25,000g, which will automatically shear all sheep from the ",["l","畜棚","barn"]," in which it is placed."]]]]]}